WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Guys, I am so excited
about this.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:04.137 size:78% position:39%
We have John Travolta
on the show tonight!

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:07.073 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:10.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this weekend is
actually the 40th anniversary

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:11.845 size:81% position:41% line:92%
of the movie "Grease."

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.681 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.050
To celebrate,
President Trump and Kim Jong-un

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
sang a duet of
"You're the One that I Want."

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
Isn't that nice?
It's really sweet.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.388 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Sweet. That's so sweet.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Trump got back
to the White House today.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
He walked through the doors
and yelled, "I'm home!"

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then remembered
he fired everyone.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.661 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
Actually the people
at the White House

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
are pretty excited
that Trump is back.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, just take a look at
what they had to say.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sarah Huckabee Sanders said,
"Oh. Good."

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:37.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chief of Staff John Kelly
was like,

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So jazzed to hear
all about the trip."

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.075 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
Melania Trump said, "Wait.
He's back, like, now?"

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:45.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally, the White House
kitchen staff screamed,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.418
"Code red! Defrost the nuggets!
Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:56.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get me -- dinosaur -- dinosaur
shape, dinosaur shaped!"

00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:00.560
But Trump is really excited to
tell everyone about the summit.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.327 line:92%
In an interview last night

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:04.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump talked about how
he and Kim really hit it off.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe a bit too much.
Watch this.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Could you tell
at the beginning?

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
What was your --
What was that first minute?

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I felt very good
at the beginning.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
The relationship
was really good.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's got
a very good personality.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:17.911 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's funny.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's been a very intense
relationship.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's been short
and very intense.

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sounds like somebody is going
to the fantasy suite.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:30.824 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.925 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It makes sense, though.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.859 line:92%
Kim is totally Trump's type.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's foreign and half his age,
so it's very --

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.330 line:92%
[ Audience groans, laughs ]

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.898 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey-oh!

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"He was gentle
and he was kind."

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.001 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I was big spoon.
He was little un."

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:49.576 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:50.276 size:81% position:41% line:92%
This is big, you guys.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
It came out today that Trump's
lawyer, Michael Cohen,

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:56.483
might flip on the president
in the Russia investigation.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:57.851 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Here's a photo of Cohen.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:00.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, that's called
resting snitch face.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
But here's some good news
for the President.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.424 line:92%
Tomorrow is his birthday.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.725 line:92%
The White House is filled with

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
balloons,
champagne, and streamers.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.596
He was flattered until
he realized it was all left over

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:13.333
from the party the staff threw
when he left for North Korea.

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:17.137 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:20.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
Tomorrow Trump turns 72.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he doesn't
tweet a day over 12.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's very nice.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.645 line:92%
Actually today it was announced

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:28.548
that the U.S. will host
the 2026 World Cup with Mexico.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:31.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
Players can either travel from
the U.S. to Mexico by plane

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.754
or just walk past the wall
that still won't be built.

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:37.223
It's up to you. You can choose.
[ Applause ]

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.293
Finally, guys, I saw that Uber
is working out a new feature

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:43.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
that can tell if you're drunk
when you request a ride.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:44.330 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Here's how it works.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
If it's 2:00 a.m. and you call
an Uber, you're drunk.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.568 size:78% position:39% line:92%
We have a great show.

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:50.370 line:92%
Give it up for the Roots!

